# Coverage output (make cover).
coverage.out
coverage.html

# Compiled test binaries and profiles.
*.test
*.exe
*.out
cpu.prof
mem.prof
*.pprof

# Note on what is deliberately NOT ignored:
#
#   testdata/fuzz/**   Crash reproducers found by fuzzing. Go re-runs these as
#                      ordinary tests, so committing one turns a fuzz finding
#                      into a permanent regression test. Keep them.
#
#   viz_*.html         Generated visualization samples, currently tracked on
#                      purpose. Whether they should stay is an open question,
#                      not an oversight.
